From c96db0ab75c875d1d9b144adc129816ef6b9ecc7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: miroe <260228444+boartat@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 10:08:45 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] dxmt: MUMA v2 - idle limit and memory budget after DXVK's
 allocator

On top of MUMA v1, the spare trim follows the policy of DXVK's memory
allocator (src/dxvk/dxvk_memory.cpp, zlib license,
https://github.com/doitsujin/dxvk). The policy is reimplemented for
DXMT's structures; no DXVK code is copied.
- Idle limit (freeEmptyChunksInPool: 4 max-size chunks of mapped
  memory): idle spares past min(1 GB, budget / 8) are freed regardless
  of age.
- Memory budget (updateMemoryHeapBudgets): the Metal device's
  recommendedMaxWorkingSetSize minus a reserve of 1% clamped to
  4-256 MB. While the device is over budget every idle spare is freed,
  and makeRoom() frees idle spares before a new allocation that would
  exceed it (called outside the holder's lock).
- The time rule frees at most 256 MB (DXVK's max chunk size) per pass.
- Kept from v1: the per-queue trim thread independent of submissions
  (DXVK's timed tasks run only after a submission), purgeable spares,
  lock-free registration, dynamic textures, the 2 s rule.
- MIROE_MUMA_MAX_IDLE_MB and MIROE_MUMA_BUDGET_MB (e.g. to act like a
  smaller Mac) for measurements.

Engine/tests/c on ARM64 Wine + FEX, M4 Pro (budget 18004 MB): after the
burst, buffers 308 MB, idle application 308 MB, dynamic textures 196 MB,
all as v1; reused spares verify; small discards 3.243 vs v1 3.262
ms/frame. Game-like test, 3 runs each: after the fights 645/629 MB as v1.
With an 800 MB budget, in-fight peaks average 1061/1156 MB vs v1
1094/1213 MB, and the second fight's peak stays at 1153-1157 MB where v1
ranges 1046-1365 MB; fight frame times (avg/p99/max) are within run
spread of v1. Most of the peak is memory in use, which no trim policy
can return.

Source: miroe (Miro project). License: LGPL-2.1-or-later, like DXMT.
Written with AI assistance: per DXMT's CONTRIBUTING this is not for an
upstream pull request.
